E. Downtown Core (DC) land use category is compatible with DT-MU District. Appropriate uses in the Downtown Core include:
• High-density residential development of up to twelve (12) dwelling units per net acre, such as apartments, flats, and condominiums.
• Small-scale retail, restaurants, cafes, coffee shops, offices, and personal services (e.g., salons, day spas, dry cleaners) to create an active street-level experience.
• Ground floors of buildings should be reserved for retail, office, and service uses, with upper floors dedicated to office and residential units.
